SUMMARY:👽 E.T. THE EXTRA-TERRESTRIAL — ONLY $4.99! 🎬
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 👽 
 E.T. THE EXTRA-TERRESTRIAL — ONLY $4.99! 🎬\n\n**Saturday\, October 24
 \, 2026**\nCome see one of the greatest and most beloved movies ever made 
 — **[on the big screen for an incredible $4.99!](https://www.cineplex.co
 m/movie/et-the-extraterrestrial-family-favourites-2019)**\nSeriously… **
 $4.99!** It's hard to find much of anything in Toronto for that price\, le
 t alone a classic movie at Cineplex. 🍿\n\n### ⭐ WHY SEE E.T.?\n\nIf y
 ou've never seen *E.T.* on the big screen\, this is a great opportunity.\n
 Steven Spielberg's 1982 classic is so much more than a movie about an alie
 n. It's a funny\, exciting\, touching adventure about **friendship\, child
 hood\, courage and saying goodbye**.\n\nIt's one of those rare movies that
  works for practically everyone — whether you're seeing it for the first
  time or haven't watched it in years.\nAnd let's be honest: **E.T. saying 
 "phone home" on a giant movie screen is worth $4.99 all by itself.** 👽
 📞\n\nThe movie stars **Henry Thomas\, Drew Barrymore and Dee Wallace**\
 , and remains one of Spielberg's most enduring films. Cineplex describes i
 t as an unforgettable story of a lost alien and the young boy who helps hi
 m find his way home.\n\n### 🎟️ ONLY $4.99!\n\n**That's right — just
  $4.99!**\n[This is Cineplex's ](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/et-the-ext
 raterrestrial-family-favourites-2019)**[Family Favourites](https://www.cin
 eplex.com/movie/et-the-extraterrestrial-family-favourites-2019)**[ program
 ming\, with ](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/et-the-extraterrestrial-famil
 y-favourites-2019)*[E.T.](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/et-the-extraterre
 strial-family-favourites-2019)*[ scheduled for Saturday\, October 24.](htt
 ps://www.cineplex.com/movie/et-the-extraterrestrial-family-favourites-2019
 )\n\n**Movie runtime:** 1 hour 55 minutes\n\n### 🌅 EARLY SCREENING = MO
 RE OF YOUR DAY FREE!\n\nOne of the best things about this Meetup is that i
 t's an **early screening**.\nCome out for the movie in the morning/early a
 fternoon\, enjoy *E.T.* on the big screen\, and you'll still have **most o
 f the day left to do other things**.\nGrab lunch afterward\, explore Toron
 to\, meet up with friends\, go shopping\, check out another event — what
 ever you feel like doing.\n\n**Movie first. Whole day still ahead!**\n\n##
 # 📍 LOCATION\n\n**Cineplex location: TO BE DETERMINED**\nI'll post the 
 theatre and exact screening time once confirmed[. It'll likely be midtown 
 and around 11AM or so](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/et-the-extraterrestr
 ial-family-favourites-2019)\n\n### 🎬 WATCH THE TRAILER\n\n**Official E.
 T. trailer on YouTube:**\n[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wZNInG8kSiA](ht
 tps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wZNInG8kSiA)\n\n### 👽 COME JOIN US!\n\nIf
  you've been looking for an excuse to revisit *E.T.*\, this is it.\n**$4.9
 9. Big screen. Spielberg. E.T.**\nThat's a pretty great Saturday morning.\
 nCome watch a classic!
