 cket & transport
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎤 
 Niagara Falls Road Trip: André-Philippe Gagnon – Greatest Hits\n\n📅 
 **Wednesday\, October 28\, 2026**\n📍 **Meet at Christie Station\, Toron
 to**\n🚗 **Travel in a Kia Soul with SiriusXM Radio**\n💰 **Just $50 T
 OTAL!**\n\nCome along for a fun evening road trip to Niagara Falls to see 
 the incredible **André-Philippe Gagnon – Greatest Hits** at the **Avalo
 n Theatre at Fallsview Casino Resort**!\nAndré-Philippe Gagnon is renowne
 d for his musical impressions\, comedy and ability to recreate the voices 
 of some of the world's biggest musical stars. The Greatest Hits show takes
  audiences on a musical journey through the songs and artists that have cr
 eated the soundtrack of our lives.\n\n### 🎟️ What's Included\n\n**$50
  total includes:**\n\n* 🎫 Your concert ticket\n* 🚗 Round-trip transp
 ortation from **Christie Station**\n* 📻 A fun road trip in the **Kia So
 ul with SiriusXM**\n* 🌊 An evening in Niagara Falls\n\n### 🕓 Schedul
 e\n\n**4:30 PM** – Depart Toronto from Christie Station\nWe'll head towa
 rd Niagara Falls after work. Depending on traffic and how quickly we get t
 here\, **we may have a little time to stop and do some sightseeing** befor
 e the show.\n\n**8:30 PM** – André-Philippe Gagnon: Greatest Hits\n📍
  Avalon Theatre\, Fallsview Casino Resort\n\nThe show is scheduled for **8
 :30 PM on Wednesday\, October 28**.\n\n**After the show** – Head back to
  Toronto\n\n**Approximately 11:45 PM** – Expected arrival back at Christ
 ie Station\, depending on traffic.\n\n### 🚨 VERY LIMITED SPOTS!\n\nThis
  is a **small-group road trip**\, so there are only a very limited number 
 of seats available in the Kia Soul.\n**Your spot is NOT confirmed until th
 e $50 e-transfer is received.**\n\n💸 Send $50 by e-transfer to:\nnicola
 sbello@yahoo.com\n\nOnce your e-transfer is received\, your spot will be l
 ocked in.\n\n### 🎭 Event Information\n\nThe show takes place at the **A
 valon Theatre\, 6380 Fallsview Boulevard\, Niagara Falls**.\n👉 **Offici
 al event page:**\n[André-Philippe Gagnon – Fallsview Casino Resort](htt
 ps://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/an
 dre-philippe-gagnon.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### ⚠️ Please Note
 \n\nThis is a **road trip**\, not a bus tour.\n\nReturn times are approxim
 ate and can be affected by **Toronto traffic\, QEW traffic and road condit
 ions**.\n\nCome for the music\, stay for the road-trip atmosphere\, and le
 t's make a night of it in Niagara Falls! 🎶🚗🌊
